      "original_statement": "股价先站上EMA，EMA稳定上行，收盘价涨过抵扣价，MA跟着拐头",
      "source_section": "体系§2.2；实现§4.2、§4.3、§5、A4",
      "proxy_definition": "{\"formula\": \"X[t]=log(1+age[t]), age consecutive E20=true and S20=false sessions through t\", \"parameters\": {\"E\": \"close[t]>first-valid-close seeded EMA20[t], exactly current D01 seed alpha2/21; equality false\", \"S\": \"close[t]>close[t-20], equality false; E-only is E and NOT S\", \"wait_age\": \"count of consecutive calendar sessions through t with E-only true. Compute from segment history once E/S both known at21 quotes, not only formal dates. Unknown-start spell is left-censored until E-only ends; no invented prehistory. Missing resets. If S confirms while E remains true, spell ends confirmed at that close; if E becomes false first or simultaneously, failed; formal end/cutoff ongoing. New E-only later is new spell even if E never dropped. No minimum-day stability threshold or max-wait stop.\", \"added\": \"log1p(wait_age); positive only eligible E-only observations with uncensored age. Fixed monotone compression chosen before outcome; untransformed age retained.\", \"baseline_features\": [\"prior20high_distance\", \"ret20\", \"ema20_distance\", \"r1\", \"vol20\", \"sma60_up\", \"asset_510050\", \"asset_510500\", \"asset_588000\", \"deduction_box_distance\"], \"baseline_box\": \"exact D01 added:100*(close[t]/max(close[t-19:t-9])-1), includes historical closes t-19..t-10 inclusive\", \"population\": \"all4340scheduled days retained, current E/S states and unknown reason retained; estimation only continuous252economic OHLC, E-only and uncensored current wait age. No selection by later confirmation/success.\", \"target\": \"100*max(0,1-min(close[t+1:t+22])/close[t+1])\", \"EMA_compatibility\": \"first-close seed follows D01, differs from production SMA-seededEMA. No production change.\"}, \"unit\": \"log1p sessions; original age sessions retained\", \"direction\": \"风险方向由检验决定\", \"transforms\": \"V01来源绑定经济价格；EMA按D01首收盘种子alpha2/21，与生产SMA种子区分\", \"nan_policy\": \"缺失重置；初次21日状态已在等待则左截断至该段结束；252只控制资格而不重置年龄\", \"endpoints\": \"t及以前的完整日线；未来收盘路径t+1..t+21，含首尾\"}",
